        "notes": "It doesn't matter too much what you pick for round 2. Personally I go for  [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) which combined with  [Cosmic Coolant](item_5584169d-94af-4efa-955c-263353a75553) should allow us to fire off a decent number of Pulsar Torpedoes in a single round.\n\nSome alternative rares you could pick are  [Lock-On Shield](item_220287f8-1dc5-4a6c-9e86-c14cf970b689) or  [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) for self healing.  [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) or  [Reinforced Titanium](item_8ebaa7db-aedf-48ed-adc1-318cb46a3214) for better protection, or  [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) for help again Dynamite or Sleep Dart.\n\nBasically any rare survival ability is a good alternative to  [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56)  if you so wish.",
